      "short_description": "A tasty and nutritious recovery bar that activates recovery immediately after exercise.",
      "description": "<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Product Description</strong></h2><p>Recovery Bar is great for endurance athletes who want to trigger efficient muscle recovery immediately after intense exercise, when the body is more predisposed to nutrient absorption.</p><p>The formula is based on a 4:1 ratio of carbohydrates to proteins, two crucial nutrients for replenishing energy reserves. glycogen and trigger muscle repair and growth.</p><h4><strong>Why carbohydrates?</strong></h4><p>Carbohydrates are key after exercise to restore depleted glycogen levels, allowing you to regain energy in time for your next workout.</p><h4><strong>Why protein?</strong></h4><p>Proteins are essential for repairing and rebuilding muscle tissues that may have been damaged during intense physical activity.</p><h4><strong>The 4:1 carbohydrate-protein ratio</strong></h4><p>The 4:1 ratio is effective because it provides enough carbohydrates to quickly replenish glycogen and protein stores to improve muscle adaptations to training.</p><p><br></p><blockquote>Start effective muscle recovery after exercise with the Recovery Bar!</blockquote><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Product Benefits</strong></h2><ul><li>Accelerates muscle recovery</li><li>Replenishes glycogen reserves</li><li>Helps hydration</li><li>Easy to digest</li><li>Does not melt in heat</li><li>Very practical</li><li>Suitable for vegans</li></ul><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Recommended Use</strong></h2><p>Eat 1 or 2 recovery bars after training.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Nutritional Information </strong></h2><p><strong>50 g (1 bar)</strong></p><p><strong>Energy </strong>633.4 kJ / 152.1 kcal</p><p><strong>Total Fats</strong>3.2 g <strong>Saturated Fats</strong>0.9 g</p><p><strong>Total Carbohydrates</strong>21.7 g</p><p><strong>Sugars</strong>14.3 g</p><p><strong>Fiber</strong>6.9 g</p><p><strong>Protein</strong>5.2 g</p><p>Salt 125 mg</p><h2><strong>Ingredients  </strong></h2><p><strong>T</strong>ames, oat flour (GLUTEN), chicory root fiber, almond paste (DRIED FRUITS), dark chocolate chips (cocoa mass, cane sugar, cocoa butter, cocoa powder), isolated pea protein, date syrup, almond flour (DRIED FRUITS), cocoa powder, vegetable oil (coconut), emulsifier: lecithin, natural flavor. The product may contain traces of nuts, gluten, soy, dairy products and eggs. Store in a cool, dry place. Suitable for vegans.</p>"
