      "description": "<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Product Description</strong></h2><p>Electrolytes 4Energy, a blend of all essential minerals and no calories, helps you maintain optimal hydration during exercise;</p><p>The formula with sodium, potassium, magnesium and calcium helps your body function smoothly and helps prevent cramps muscles.</p><h4><strong>4Energy Electrolyte Mixture</strong></h4><p><strong>Sodium -</strong> helps conduct nerve impulses, contract and relax muscles and maintain the correct balance of water and minerals.</p><p><strong>Potassium -</strong> helps nerve and muscle function and transport nutrients to cells.</p><p><strong>Magnesium -</strong>It helps with muscle contraction and reduces tiredness and fatigue.</p><p><strong>Calcium -</strong> is necessary for the proper functioning of the heart, muscles and nerves.</p><p><br></p><blockquote>Balance your electrolytes with Electrolytes 4Energy.</blockquote><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Benefits of Product</strong></h2><ul><li>Maintains optimal hydration</li><li>Prevents muscle cramps</li><li>Zero calories</li><li>Supports all body functions</li><li>Regulates body temperature</li><li>No digestive problems</li><li>Accelerates muscle recovery</li></ul><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Recommended Use</strong></h2><p>Dissolve one effervescent capsule in 200<strong>–</strong>300 ml of water. Take up to 4 times a day.</p><p>We recommend this product for exercises lasting less than two hours, Ideal for a game of Padel.</p><p>For longer workouts, also consider supplementing with carbohydrates.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Nutritional Information</strong></h2><p>1 effervescent tablet</p><p>Sodium 250 mg</p><p>Potassium70 mg (3.5% RDA)</p><p>Calcium10 mg (1% DDR)</p><p>Magnesium50 mg (13% DDR)</p><h2><strong>Ingredients</strong></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Sodium bicarbonate, potassium citrate, sodium chloride, calcium citrate, magnesium citrate, acidity regulator: citric acid, bulking agent: sorbitols, flavoring, red beetroot concentrate, anti-caking agent: polyethylene glycol, sweetener: sucralose. </span></p><p>May contain derivatives of gluten, soy, milk. </p><h2><strong>Quantity</strong></h2><p>20 effervescent tablets.</p>"
