      "short_description": "4on SwiftGrip Provides a firmer and improved grip on the padel racket.",
      "description": "<p>Its composition and shape guarantee excellent control and comfort, weighing just 17-18 g. </p><p>SwiftGrip also reduces vibrations and helps prevent injuries such as arm pain and epicondylitis. </p><p>With the included 4on Overgrip, you can experience the difference of an overgrip designed to absorb sweat and keep your hands dry.</p><p><strong>Instructions: </strong></p><p>Remove all overgrips and the original grip from your racket handle. </p><p>Fold the straps and place them inside the handle.</p><p>Insert the handle, ensuring the logo is on the front and back of the handle. </p><p>Remove each strip while holding the handle in place. </p><p>Test adhesion and adjust if necessary. </p><p>Finally, apply the <a href=\"https://boostpadel.store/product.html?id=024ec383-513e-4fd6-8df9-2de966853f55\" target=\"_blank\">4on Overgrip.</a></p><p><br></p><p>Improves grip and reduces hand sweat</p><p>Reduces vibrations</p><p>Helps prevent arm injuries and epicondylitis</p><p>Universal fit for all padel rackets</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Includes: </strong>1 x SwiftGrip and 1 x 4on Overgrip</p><p><br></p><p>Upgrade your padel racket and try it the difference with SwiftGrip from 4on.</p>"
