      "name": "4Endurance VIT+MIN",
      "short_description": "A vitamin and mineral formula that provides all the micronutrients your body needs in a single capsule.",
      "description": "<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Product Description</strong></h2><p>Vit+Min is a vitamin and mineral formula designed for endurance athletes who want to obtain the total daily dose of micronutrients in a single capsule.</p><p>Contains 25 active ingredients (13 vitamins and 12 minerals), including vitamin B12 and iron. This allows you to strengthen your immune system and maintain electrolyte balance, improving your well-being and athletic performance.</p><h4><strong>Optimal doses</strong></h4><p>Vit+Min contains the exact doses of vitamins and minerals that your body needs - 100% of the daily needs in a single capsule.</p><p>Excessive doses of vitamins and minerals are ineffective. The majority will not be absorbed and will be eliminated with water, putting unnecessary strain on your digestive system.</p><p>The exception is vitamin B12, of which athletes need much more. This vitamin is essential for increasing your energy metabolism.</p><p><br></p><blockquote>100% of the recommended daily dose of all micronutrients in a single capsule.</blockquote><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Product Benefits</strong></h2><ul><li>Strengthens the immune system</li><li>100% DDR in one capsule</li><li>With 25 active ingredients</li><li>Increases energy metabolism</li><li>High dose of vitamin B12</li><li>90 capsules for 90 days</li></ul><p><br></p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Recommended Use</strong></h2><p>Take one capsule a day with a meal and plenty of water.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">Ingredients</strong></h2><p> <strong>Per serving (1 capsule)</strong></p><p>Vitamin A 800 mg</p><p>Vitamin D 5 mcg</p><p>Vitamin E 18 IU</p><p>Vitamin K2-MK7 5 mcg</p><p>Vitamin B1 1.1 mg</p><p>Vitamin B2 1.4 mg</p><p>Vitamin B3 16 mg</p><p>Vitamin B5 6 mg</p><p>Vitamin B6 14 mg</p><p>Vitamin B9 200 mcg</p><p>Vitamin B12 50 mcg</p><p>Vitamin B7 50 mcg</p><p>Vitamin C 80 mg</p><p>Calcium 8.4 mg</p><p>Magnesium 56 mg</p><p>Iron 14 mg</p><p>Copper 1 mg</p><p>Iodine150 mcg</p><p>Zinc 10 mg</p><p>Manganese 2 mg</p><p>Potassium 40.2 mg</p><p>Selenium 55 mcg</p><p>Chromium 40 mcg</p><p>Molybdenum 10 mcg</p><p>Sodium 23 mg</p><p><strong>Food supplement. Ingredients</strong> (per capsule)<strong>:</strong></p><p><strong>Vitamin A</strong> 800 mcg (as retinyl acetate) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin D</strong> 5 mcg (as cholecalciferol {100%}, <strong>Vitamin E</strong> 18 IU (as Dl-alpha-tocopheryl acetate) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin K2-MK7</strong> 5 mcg (as menaquinone) {7% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin B1</strong> 1.1 mg (as thiamine) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin B2</strong> 1.4 mg (as riboflavin) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin B3</strong> 16 mg (as niacin) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin B5</strong> 6 mg (as pantothenic acid) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin B6</strong> 14 mg (as pyridosine) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Vitamin B9</strong> 200 mcg (as folic acid) {100% PDV*},<strong> Vitamin B12</strong> 50 mcg (as cyanocobalamin) {2000% RDA*}, <strong>VitaminB7</strong> 50 mcg (as biotin) {100% PDV*}, <strong>Vitamin C</strong> 80 mg (as ascorbic acid) {100% RDA*},<strong> Calcium</strong> 8.4 mg (as calcium carbonate) {1% RDA*}, <strong>Magnesium</strong> 56 mg (as magnesium oxide) {15% RDA*}, <strong>Iron</strong>14 mg (as ferrous fumarate) {100% RDA*},<strong> Copper</strong> 1 mg (as copper sulfate) {100%*},<strong> Iodine</strong> 150 mcg (as potassium iodide) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Zinc</strong> 10 mg (as potassium citrate) zinc) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Manganese</strong> 2 mg (as manganese sulfate) {100 %*}, <strong>Potassium</strong> 40.2 mg (as potassium chloride) {2%*} <strong>Selenium</strong> 55 mcg (as sodium selenate) {100% RDA*}, <strong>Chromium</strong> 40 mcg (as chromium picolinate){100%*}, <strong>Molybdenum</strong> 10 mcg (as sodium molybdate) {20%*}, <strong>Sodium</strong> 23 mg (as sodium chloride) {1%*}. <strong>Other ingredients:</strong> vegan capsule, anti-caking agent: magnesium salts of fatty acids. </p><h2><strong>Quantity</strong></h2><p>90 capsules.</p><p> *RDA= recommended daily dose.</p>"
