      "description": "<p><strong>The Ultimate Carbon Shield for Your Racket</strong></p><p>Have you invested in a high-performance racket? Protect this investment with the <strong>Boost Padel Pro-Carbon 3K Guard,</strong> the racket protector designed to absorb the most severe impacts without compromising the balance of your game.</p><p><br></p><p>Made with professional-grade <strong>3K Carbon Fiber</strong>, this protector is not just a barrier; is an improvement in design and durability, essential for the player who takes Padel seriously.</p><p>✨ <strong>Key Features and Performance Advantages</strong></p><p>3K Carbon Construction</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Extreme Protection:</strong> Absorbs strong impacts against glass or the ground, preventing chips and breaks in the head of your racket.</p><p><strong>Ultra-Lightweight, Zero Impact on Balance:</strong> Adds minimal weight, keeping the sweet spot and original balance of your racket unchanged.</p><p><strong>High-Resistance 3M Adhesive, Permanent Fixation:</strong>Superior quality adhesive that ensures the protector does not come off during play, even in hot and humid conditions.</p><p><strong>Premium Textured Design, Aesthetics Professional:</strong>The visible carbon pattern gives a top-tier and professional finish to your racket.</p><p><strong>Universal Format (37 x 3 cm) Total Compatibility:</strong>Suitable for 100% of Padel rackets (Round, Teardrop and Diamond).</p>"
